[{"answer":"Hello, and welcome to \"Under Pressure Enterprises\", Customer Service Department.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/1.mp3"},{"answer":"This is Kelly. How may I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm calling about one of your rice cookers I just purchased.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/3.mp3"},{"answer":"What seems to be the problem, sir?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Seems? There's no seeming about it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The blasted thing shoots hot steam all over the place, that's what!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It nearly scalded my hand when I went to open it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/7.mp3"},{"answer":"While it could have killed the cat or something. It could have exploded and killed my wife and me!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir, sir, please calm down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/9.mp3"},{"answer":"As long as the steam escapes the cooker, it won't explode.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/10.mp3"},{"answer":"So you're telling me there's no problem!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you calling me a liar?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir, no one is calling you a liar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes! So I demand a full refund!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Under Pressure will be happy to refund your money, sir.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I just need some basic information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/16.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, OK. Sorry. I do tend to get a little hot under the collar.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/17.mp3"},{"answer":"My wife tells me to slow down...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what do you need to know?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir, don't worry. I just need to ask you the model number of the cooker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmmm...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/21.mp3"},{"answer":"where are my glasses? Ah, here!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/23.mp3"},{"answer":"It's R242.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/24.mp3"},{"answer":"R242? OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much did you pay for the product?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/26.mp3"},{"answer":"89.99 pounds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/27.mp3"},{"answer":"It was on sale, I guess I should tell you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, that's honest of you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, where did you buy the cooker?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Which store and which branch?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/31.mp3"},{"answer":"At that big Electric Life appliance store downtown.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/32.mp3"},{"answer":"The City Centre Branch?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/33.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/34.mp3"},{"answer":"And you say the problem is that the steam escapes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it does!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/36.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem, sir.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/37.mp3"},{"answer":"If there's steam escaping, clearly the cooker is broken or defective.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So we have an R242 cooker with an escaping steam problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/39.mp3"},{"answer":"It was bought from Electric Life's City Centre Branch for 89.99.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that correct?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/41-2019-03-30-04-23-45.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that is correct.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I nearly forgot. When did you buy the cooker?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Just as soon as my wife got the crazy idea she'll live longer if she stops eating good English food: roast beef and mash.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/44.mp3"},{"answer":"No, all she says she wants is rice and vegetables and sauces you'd not soak your feet in!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir, sir! When did you buy it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, there I go again. Let's see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/47.mp3"},{"answer":"we bought it just 6 months ago!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/48.mp3"},{"answer":"We hardly used it either.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/49.mp3"},{"answer":"But 6 months? Is that too long?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean for the warranty?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Very well, that's well within the warranty period.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what's your name and address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Name and address! What for?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir, it is company policy. If you want your money, you must inform me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Money you say?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, my name is Herbert Hewitt and my address is 84 Park Road.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that here in Coventry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/59.mp3"},{"answer":"The postal code is B0241DJ.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/60.mp3"},{"answer":"But I don't think sending things in the mail is very secure or very efficient.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't worry, Mr. Hewitt, don't worry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/63.mp3"},{"answer":"We can credit the money to your credit card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/64.mp3"},{"answer":"You do have one, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's how we paid for the cooker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes. We still have the number on the computer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I only need to ask your card's expiry date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/68.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid I never give that sort of information out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/69.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, once you have that, anyone could go charging things and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Sir! I said your expiry date, not your card's password.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, er, yes. Foolish me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, you didn't say \"password\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/74.mp3"},{"answer":"That will be April 2008.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/75.mp3"},{"answer":"April 2008.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Very well, your card still has nearly 2 months left to go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/77.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll get that refund right to you, probably by 5 o'clock this evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/78.mp3"},{"answer":"You had better!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/79.mp3"},{"answer":"If I don't get my money...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/80.mp3"},{"answer":"wait, wait. Yes, I know I'm losing my temper again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/81.mp3"},{"answer":"I really am sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/82.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't had my medicine today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/83.mp3"},{"answer":"And sir, just one more question for our record.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/84.mp3"},{"answer":"How often do you go shopping at the City Centre Branch?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, well it's hard to say.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/86.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose maybe once a month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/87.mp3"},{"answer":"But I can tell you this, if I don't get my refund, I'll never shop there again!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh.. I think it's time to start looking for another job!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-listening-9-2019-03-26-04-04-36/89.mp3"}]
